OL,16,G0306FOutlook
OL,17,     GIn 1986 Beverly Glenn-Copeland
OL,18,     Gmade an experimental album in a
OL,19,     Gremote Canadian cabin. A few
OL,20,     Gcopies were sold and it was
OL,21,     Galmost forgotten - until 30 years
OL,22,     Glater it became a cult hit.
